WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,380
I used to think training was torture

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:05,340
Now that I don’t practice for a day, I feel uncomfortable all over.

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:09,330
This feeling of getting stronger

4
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:12,380
It’s so satisfying, boss

5
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:14,260
When do you think we can leave?

6
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,060
Become what you call a floating army

7
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:19,880
Since you are so impatient

8
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,840
Then all of you will train twice as much from now on.

9
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:25,120
I guarantee that you will become

10
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,320
The real float army

11
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:32,700
Why is there no movement at all in Beiman?

12
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:34,970
After that big gift package

13
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:36,930
slightly over the top

14
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:47,860
Does any of you know what this is?

15
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:49,660
Isn’t it already late autumn?

16
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:50,900
Is it almost winter?

17
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:54,090
The Northern Manchu Dynasty was located in the north

18
00:00:54,290 --> 00:00:56,570
The further north you go, the colder the winter becomes.

19
00:00:56,970 --> 00:00:58,690
So every year it’s almost winter

20
00:00:58,890 --> 00:01:00,850
There will be some northern Manchurian oil curtain tribes

21
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,890
Move south to avoid the cold
